;Kenney Input Prompts 1.5, trimmed to the glyphs listed in the motif.
;Every icon is imported once. [Glyphs] names each keyboard and gamepad
;sprite, and [Controller Glyphs] points controllers at their own group.
;Groups below 1000 are the original command-list glyphs.
;1051 keyboard, 1200 Xbox (base gamepad), 1300 PlayStation,
;1400 Nintendo Switch 1/2, 1500 arcade.
;Index 30 and up in each family is device artwork for the icon list.
;Shared artwork is imported once; [Controller Glyphs] maps the rest.
;0 always import the palette, 1 import only if all colors doesn't match to any existing palette
noDuplicatePal = 0

